WEBVTT

00:08:58.839 --> 00:09:01.489
to bring INCRA to life.

00:09:01.489 --> 00:09:04.100
I truly believe building up INCRA

00:09:04.100 --> 00:09:06.491
is in everyone's interest,

00:09:06.491 --> 00:09:10.061
and that we have the unique opportunity right now

00:09:10.061 --> 00:09:12.630
to turn INCRA into a cornerstone

00:09:12.630 --> 00:09:17.025
of a new, more inclusive financial system.

00:09:17.025 --> 00:09:19.593
Because for way too long,

00:09:19.593 --> 00:09:23.285
we have left the big financial players on their own.

00:09:23.285 --> 00:09:26.081
It's time to give them some company.

00:09:26.081 --> 00:09:28.115
Thank you.

00:09:28.115 --> 00:09:32.115
(Applause)